  "Nuvvu na life lo oka special person maatrame kaadhu, na face meedha teliyakunda smile theppinche person vi. Nuvvu happy ga unte naaku happy ga untundhi. Nee dreams anni nijam avvali, nee life lo happiness eppudu thaggakudadhu ani manaspoorthiga korukuntunna. ðŸ’—",
